DECnsr for OSF/1 is available! In can be licensed both as a single package,
meant for single systems and as a client server package, including a server
and multiple client licences, depending on your needs. The server license
is dependent on the backup server's CPU type, i.e. fixed cost regardless of
the number of clients. For every client, a license is required - either
for UNIX systems or PCs with appropriate pricing. Below is an excerpt from
the product description.

