  DESCRIPTION

  POLYCENTER NetWorker Save and Restore (NSR) for DEC OSF/1 AXP provides
  backup services to a single system or to a group of systems via a
  TCP/IP network.

  A backup operation is a routine system-management function that makes
  copies of data to ensure data availability. A restore operation
  retrieves data from backup copies, when needed.

  Features

  o  Online backups

