     unattended backup to tape loader and jukebox devices

  o  Easy backup, restore, and fast file location operations by users
     and administrators

  o  Media management index for tracking media

  o  Simultaneous backup of multiple remote file systems to reduce
     backup time

  o  Simultaneous output to multiple devices

  o  Supported backup media includes raw disk, file or tape

  o  Support for data compression and encryption

  o  Local system administration from Motif[R] graphical user interface
     and command line

  o  Remote system administration from native client graphical user
     interface and/or command line

