You can restore your old INITTAB with following steps:

1. Boot from your OSF/1 Vx.x for AXP Systems CD
   
   >>> boot dka400 

2. Select System Management

3. Make special device file for your system disk
   something like
     cd /dev
     ./MAKEDEV rz3

4. Mount system disk
     mount /dev/rrz3a /mnt
     
5. Restore INITTAB
    something like
 
      dd < /mnt/etc/inittb.saved > /mnt/etc/inittab

