Did you setup /etc/svc.conf correctly (so that gethostby...(3) resolve
names and addresses by querying bind)?

>"arp -a" only uses the local /etc/hosts table to resolve IP addresses.
This is not the case at our installation;  arp resolves addresses by using
bind and shows the fully qualified hostname, even for hosts not in the local
file.  Maybe yuo want to check your BIND setup with nslookup?

