Here's a little patch to make xlockmore work on alphas running OSF1 V1.3.

The image, maze and life modes did not work because the alpha X server
wanted the bits_per_pixel field set to one for the bitmaps.

Also, I don't like the SUN logo on my screens, so I've changed the
bitmaps. If you wnat to try out my bitmaps, add -DOLDENBURG to CCOPTIONS.

				Klaus

