latex testit.tex 
dvips -D 100 -o testit.ps testit.dvi -P 100 

The printer file, config.100, is

D 100
M DEClarge

where DEClarge is a 100 dpi mode in modes.mf (but the same
problem occurs regardless of what printer (-P), resolution,
or mode is choosen.

Ghostscript produces only a rectangular box, no text of any kind.
This is a bug in ghostscript.

