Richard;

  I've never tried building Xv-3.00 on OSF/1 v1.3, but have successfully
built it on OSF/1 v2.0 (release 240) with the following changes:

  In the ./xv-3.00/tiff directory, edit the Imakefile to replace the
leading spaces with tabs in:

57a58,61
> g3states.h: mkg3states.c t4.h
>         -${RM} g3states.h
>         ${CC} -o mkg3states ${CFLAGS} mkg3states.c
>         ./mkg3states > g3states.h || rm g3states.h */
59,64c63
< g3states.h:   mkg3states.c t4.h
<       -${RM} g3states.h
<       ${CC} -o mkg3states ${CFLAGS} mkg3states.c
<       ./mkg3states > g3states.h || rm g3states.h
<
< depend::      g3states.h

 Sorry the diffs don't show up better :), but the make on OSF/1 doesn't
like leading spaces in places where there should be tab characters.
That's it! Hopefully this will also fix your 1.3 compile problem. Just
cd .. ; xmkmf; make depend; make all; make install.

