Hi,

Just the binaries will work fine.
You can use the binary just about as soon as you decompress and untar it
provided you have a proxy server on your firewall machine. (I highly
recommend CERN httpd server)  

To use the XMosaic with the proxy server you need the following environment
variables in your environment (ksh convention) :

export http_proxy="http://your.proxy.server/"
export ftp_proxy="http://your.proxy.server/"
export gopher_proxy="http://your.proxy.server/"
export news_proxy="http://your.proxy.server/"
export wais_proxy="http://your.proxy.server/"

News and Wais may not work depending on the proxy server's capabilities.

Hope this helps.

