Toby,

all problems of hanging LAN Workplace <-> OSF/1 connections I have heard
of are related to LWP's inability to handle TCP window sizes > 8k. OSF/1
used 32k by default. To check, you can patch the running kernel:

# dbx -k /vmunix /dev/mem
(dbx) assign tcp_sendspace = 8192
(dbx) assign tcp_recvspace = 8192
(dbx) quit
#

Now try LWP, it should work! A path for this problem is available from Novell.

							Regards,

								Roland


